parameters.tooltip:
Add custom fields, in the JSON format, to the ticket request that you want to create in ServiceDesk Plus. For example, 
{
  "level": {
    "name": "Tier 3"
  },
  "category": {
    "name": "Network"
  }
}

parameters.description:
(Optional) Add custom fields, in the JSON format, to the ticket request that you want to create in ServiceDesk Plus. For example, 
{
  "level": {
    "name": "Tier 3"
  },
  "category": {
    "name": "Network"
  }
}

parameters.tooltip:
Specify custom fields, in the JSON format, that you want to use for filtering open tickets whose details you want to retrieve from ServiceDesk Plus. For example, {
  "urgency.name": "Low"
}

